<title>CHINA: SHOUGANG INTL, SHOUGANG CENTURY SUSPENDED.</title>
<headline>SHOUGANG INTL, SHOUGANG CENTURY SUSPENDED.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in Shougang Concord International Enterprises Co Ltd and Shougang Concord Century Holdings Ltd shares was suspended at the companies' request pending an announcement, the stock exchange said.</p>
</text>
